# Bike Sales Analysis Dashboard

## Overview

An Excel-based analysis of 1,000 customer records to understand
bike purchasing patterns across different customer segments.

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Excel
- PivotTables
- PivotCharts
- Excel formulas
- Data cleaning
- Dashboard creation

## Analysis

The project analyzes bike purchases based on:

- Age Group
- Income Bracket
- Commute Distance
- Occupation

## Key Findings

- Middle Age customers had the highest purchase rate among age groups: 54.64%.
- Customers commuting 2–5 miles had the highest purchase rate: 59.79%.
- High Income customers had the highest purchase rate among income brackets: 52.63%.
- Professional customers had the highest purchase rate among occupations: 54.35%.

